  {
    "name": "computer_interact",
    "description": "Perform one action against a fresh observation of the approved window. Prefer invoke/set_value/select/toggle/expand/collapse with elementId over pixel input. type inserts Unicode; set_value replaces a field value. key is one chord (modifiers plus one key). Coordinates are pixels in the last returned image. focus and drag require a foreground session. The target must still match; stale, protected, unsupported or off-target actions fail. Poll job_get, then observe again to verify the result. A completed input call does not prove the application completed the intended task.",
